<title>USA: American Realty Trust sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>American Realty Trust sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Realty Trust Inc said its board will effect a two-for-one stock split with a record date of February 17.</p>
<p>The company said the stock split will entitle stockholders to receive one additional newly issued share of common stock for each share held as of the record date.</p>
</text>
